72e8a025abf9.plain:
Blessing, warp charge 6. If it is manifested, pick one of your <CHAPTER> units within 18" of this Psyker. These effects last until the start of your next Psychic phase:
• you can re-roll its Advance rolls and charge rolls;
• it fights first in the Fight phase if it starts that phase within Engagement Range of an enemy unit.

d798a5068510.plain:
Blessing (Aura), warp charge 7. If it is manifested, until the start of your next Psychic phase:
• attacks against any unit within 6" of this Psyker can't be saved with invulnerable saves;
• any enemy Psyker unit within 6" of this Psyker halves the total of each Psychic test it takes.

e35dc67a15f8.plain:
Malediction, warp charge 6. If it is manifested, pick one enemy unit within 18" of this Psyker that it can see. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, that unit's models:
• get 1 subtracted from their Leadership;
• subtract 1 from the hit roll of every attack they make.

e5ec9b92da46.plain:
Use at the end of your Movement phase. Pick one BLOOD ANGELS CORE JUMP PACK unit from your army that arrived on the battlefield in this phase's Reinforcements step. Until the end of the turn:
• its charge rolls can ignore any or all modifiers;
• add 1 to the hit roll of each attack its models make.
